    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d502">

                <pb facs="0505" n="415" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg415"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/3017</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul Detailed for Special Duty in Russia and
                        Siberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jameson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d502-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chelyabinsk</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-10-19"><hi rendition="#italic">October 19, 1918</hi></date>.
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 22, 3.40
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Now that peace negotiations are pending it is more vital than ever that our
                    Government act immediately in accordance with my suggestion.</p>
                <closer>[<signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Jameson</hi></signed>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d502-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d502-f1-content">
                <p>Sent via the Consulate at Vladivostok (No. 212).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
